71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xyYk_BGIR4sQ7kNvwGVJHe2&_nc_oc=AdpD6bidI1eOcc6dtblazybkymK6bKG3wY9i91w5DkxXcfpvXLW9gtn5WNTM_WsRDQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFB9YWHp7q7fXPg8dlwU49c7sjUKWLdKhGg8LtHjFIrpA&oe=6A86FCB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hBnbs3g3sisQ7kNvwEFQY17&_nc_oc=AdqlBJm0lyIKN0js8jAnLgPlks2S3xAxdLqfmeoFZX3Sm6Kh5TYc4aH3wG6_9XeIjB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_tOqA_SPjivtBLJSIBGUivyuG7Hr_4yyiY-Vb-5a98g&oe=6A86D753"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9GfKGaRWCJQQ7kNvwFyRIS7&_nc_oc=AdpeFw0h0kUVkOKK2MDbwJ-YAcU0yisjeWljuweYna75NG3RNOkwGYM5LSSNcxw8Kb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGEFzKB_tYOky7mv3swhj3SmcAKyaINZhQovDhxSv8S6g&oe=6A86D59A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: